                version="3.0.0">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="audio/ags_recall.c"
             line="9168">Finds next matching recall for type which has @provider. The @provider may be either an #AgsChannel
or an #AgsAudio object. This function tries to find the corresponding #AgsRecallChannel and #AgsRecallAudio
objects of a #AgsRecall to find. If these recalls contains the @provider, the function will return.</doc>
